        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86662, Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Square Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Rustic Modern Square Cabinet Knob is one of those pieces that people just gravitate towards. The chicness of the pairing of old world materials with modern aesthetics is alluring. This Rustic Modern Sandcast Bronze Square Knob is available in 2 sizes and 3 finish color options. This kitchen cabinet knob comes packaged with the mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Sandcast Bronze Square Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Sandcast Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86662-specifications.pdf?v=1704262412\"><b>Emtek Rustic Modern Square Cabinet Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86662-specifications.gif?v=1704354714\" width=\"600\" height=\"163\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86662 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-86662:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/4\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-86663:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 1-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-sandcast-finish.jpg?v=1704354510\" width=\"570\" height=\"191\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
